      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Set after season 5. I consider Noelleâ€™s fanfiction (Donâ€™t Go by Annacharlier) canon so youâ€™ll read references to it now and then. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There were four person, there, and they were holding Perfuma, Mermista, Frosta and Glimmer hostage. The closer one, a girl with grey wolf ears and tail, pale skin, white hair and scary pale-yellow eyes, was holding Glimmer by her hair and aiming a dagger at her throat. What made her shiver were their clothes: they were wearing the Hordeâ€™s uniforms.&lt;br /&gt;â€œHello everyoneâ€ the wolf-girl said out loud so that they could hear her. Her voice was as cold as ice, it sent a shiver down her spine. â€œI suggest you stay still, She-Ra. And you too, Catra.â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
